WEBVTT

NOTE Sherlock Jr. (1924) - Riah TV captions

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Joseph M. Schenck presents
Buster Keaton in "Sherlock Jr."
A Metro Attraction

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.900
[music]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.750
Directed by Buster Keaton

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.750
Passed by the National
Board of Review

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:12.750
The girl in the case.
(Kathryn McGuire)

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:27.000
The girl's father had nothing to
do, so he got a hired man to
help him. (Joe Keaton, Erwin
Connelly)

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:46.250
The local sheik. (Ward Crane)

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.500
"I lost a dollar.
Did you find it?"

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.500
"Describe it."

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.250
"I lost a dollar."

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:34.250
"Some one has stolen my watch."

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.750
"This looks like a
job for the police."

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:33.750
"Hey, I'm the fellow
who lost the watch."

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.000
"Why don't you search him, too?"

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:26.250
"Can you describe the man
who pawned this watch?"

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:20.750
"Some one has
stolen the pearls."

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:41.000
"We are lost! He is sending for
the world's greatest detective,
Sherlock Jr.!"

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:48.750
The crime-crushing
criminologist...

00:24:35.250 --> 00:24:36.250
"Don't bother to explain.
This is a simple case for me."

00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:38.750
"Pardon, sir. I think there
is something in your drink."

00:33:42.500 --> 00:33:47.750
"And now I'll tell you where our
little sweetie is this minute!"

00:34:04.500 --> 00:34:08.000
"And she's waiting
there for me."

00:36:48.500 --> 00:36:53.500
"Be careful or one
of us will get hurt."

00:38:30.500 --> 00:38:37.000
"I never thought you'd make it."
